      "content": "Here are a few quick archetypes for your modern urban RPG.\n\n**Successful CEO:** Impeccably tailored suit, always on a high-end device, projecting an aura of untouchable ambition and polished ruthlessness. They move through expensive districts like they own the pavement. They speak in clipped, corporate jargon.\n\n**Suspicious Alley Dweller:** Dressed in layers that hide their form, they observe everything from the shadows, body language tense and ready. They look like they've seen too much of the city's underbelly. Trust is a concept they scoff at.\n\n**Friendly Neighbor:** Warm, unassuming, and equipped with an uncanny knowledge of the neighborhood's gossip and hidden gems. They offer knowing smiles and a comforting slice of local life amidst the chaos. They are the community's gentle anchor.\n\n**High-Ranking Police Officer:** Uniform is sharp, radiating undeniable authority, but beneath the brass, they carry the weight of serious compromises. They operate on a different level than the street cops, navigating political waters as much as crime scenes. They are pragmatic to the point of exhaustion.",
