      "content": "Here are a few quick archetypes for your modern urban RPG.\n\n**Successful CEO:** Impeccably tailored suit, always on a high-end device, projecting an aura of untouchable ambition and polished ruthlessness. They move through expensive districts like they own the pavement, speaking in clipped, corporate jargon.\n\n**Suspicious Alley Dweller:** Dressed in layers that hide their form, they observe everything from the shadows, their body language tense and ready. They look like they've seen too much of the city's underbelly and view trust as a liability.\n\n**Friendly Neighbor:** Warm, unassuming, and equipped with an uncanny knowledge of the neighborhood's gossip and hidden gems. They offer knowing smiles and a comforting slice of local life amid the concrete jungle.\n\n**High-Ranking Police Officer:** Their uniform is sharp, radiating undeniable authority, but beneath the brass, they carry the visible weight of serious departmental compromises. They navigate political waters as much as crime scenes, always looking for the angle.",
